# Timestamped provider deltas in an open long conversation must reach visible
# native glyphs within 100 ms, including a long Markdown/code prefix.
fixture /render-conversation/render-stream
expect "検証プロジェクト" 30000
press 検証プロジェクト
press "Long conversation" 20000
expect "Latest interrupted conversation message is visible." 20000
type "AI に依頼する" "[render-stream] 描画の遅延を確認します"
press 送信
paint_stream "Render stream update 0." 100
paint_stream "Render stream update 3." 100
paint_stream "Render stream update 7." 100
screenshot streamed
